.vercel
.env*

# Playwright output. Generated by a test run, never source — `vite.config.ts` already excludes both
# from its watcher for the same reason. Added when the missing playwright.config.ts was written;
# without this the HTML report (hundreds of files) lands in the first commit after any e2e run.
playwright-report/
test-results/

# The original NEXT-STEP captures are SENSITIVE and must never be committed.
#
# `scripts/verify-evidence-layout.mjs` asserts this exact line is present (`:49-54`) — the check
# exists because the tree has to be on disk for the evidence gates to run while the raw captures
# must not enter history. They are ~3.5MB DOM state dumps of the live Manage page: real session
# content, not redacted fixtures.
#
# The pattern is `*.json` at that one level, deliberately narrow. It leaves the decoded, reviewed
# artifacts beside them tracked, which is what the audit actually reads.
evidence-dumps/NEXT-STEP/*.json
